+# Vsa sredstva izdaje (16 + 2 MSI + THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md = 19, od tega 4 minigw-tui) morajo obstajati, preden gre kaj na GitHub.
 for f in Mini-Gateway-$V.dmg Mini-Gateway-$V.zip minigw.zip install.sh SHA256SUMS SHA256SUMS.sig \
          minigw-{windows-amd64.exe,windows-arm64.exe,linux-amd64,linux-arm64} minigw-tray-windows-{amd64,arm64}.exe \
